  "description": "Includes functionality for address normalization in the FIAS system. Part of the Universe.Framework / Содержит функционал нормализации адресов в системе FIAS. Входит в состав Universe.Framework\n      Key features:\n      - Normalizes addresses (standardizes them according to FIAS rules).\n      - Integrates with Universe.Framework (likely a parent/base framework providing shared utilities).\n      - Extends functionality (adds FIAS-specific features on top of the framework).\n\n      About normalization. Normalization involves:\n      - Converting address parts (cities, streets) into a standardized format.\n      - Validating against FIAS database entries.\n      - Handling abbreviations (e.g., \"ул.\" → \"улица\").",
